&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve targets.&lt;/p&gt;
