&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,10,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,10,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,10,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt; is essential, with the credibility to challenge and influence senior C-level stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
